# Conformance probe pack for `with` (spec 0.18, ruling 23) under six-bit
# armor (spec 0.14; ruling 14 of 0.17). Public. No kinds. Fixed layout, one
# byte per word, most significant bit first: six bits per character.
#
#   bits 0-5     x                    character 1
#   bits 6-11    w with y             character 2: suppressed, it writes zero
#                                     bits and counts toward L
#   bits 12-17   z with s1, optional  character 3: suppressed, it is not
#                                     written and does not count toward L
#   bits 18-23   c2 with c1, optional, character 4: suppressed, it writes no
#                absent 63            sentinel (ruling 1) and does not count;
#                                     with c1 held and c2 absent, the
#                                     sentinel is written and counts
#                                     (ruling 12 of 0.14)
#
# None of y, s1 and c1 is mapped by a line of this pack: an entity that holds
# them comes from `conformance-cond-src`.
format  conformance-cond-armor
version 0.18.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    bits
bit_order msb
armor   sixbit
word_bytes 1
field   probe.x   0:0:6   uint
field   probe.w   0:6:6   uint  with probe.y
field   probe.z   1:4:6   uint  optional  with probe.s1
field   probe.c2  2:2:6   uint  optional  absent 63  with probe.c1
